換尿布時間…

240
00:10:45,252 --> 00:10:54,660
企鵝對手泰瑞，不要追我

241
00:10:54,700 --> 00:10:56,581
我的心臟跳得太快喇

242
00:10:57,302 --> 00:10:59,103
I am so upset

243
00:10:59,704 --> 00:11:02,027
I am scorned
called on a roll

244
00:11:02,067 --> 00:11:04,030
I won't be
told how to vent

245
00:11:04,070 --> 00:11:06,513
I won't cry or
sigh， I'm here to testify

246
00:11:06,553 --> 00:11:08,555
Up with the
establishment

247
